#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "Ignored addresses"
msgstr "Direcciones ignoradas"

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "One address per line. These entries are never suggested as a target, and never suggested to link to others."
msgstr "Una dirección por línea. Estas entradas no se sugieren nunca como destino ni se sugiere que enlacen a otras."

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "Ignored words"
msgstr "Palabras ignoradas"

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "One word or phrase per line. Suggestions whose anchor text contains one of them are not shown."
msgstr "Una palabra o frase por línea. No se muestran las sugerencias cuya ancla contiene alguna de ellas."

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "Keep the history of changes for"
msgstr "Conservar el historial de cambios durante"

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "Older batches are deleted by the nightly task, so you can no longer undo them. The links stay in your content. There is no limit on the number of changes kept."
msgstr "La tarea nocturna borra los lotes más antiguos y ya no se podrán deshacer. Los enlaces se quedan en tu contenido. No hay límite en el número de cambios que se conservan."

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "30 days"
msgstr "30 días"

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "90 days"
msgstr "90 días"

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "365 days"
msgstr "365 días"

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "No expiry date"
msgstr "Sin fecha de caducidad"

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "Delete all Magic Linking data when the plugin is deleted"
msgstr "Borrar todos los datos de Magic Linking al eliminar el plugin"

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "Removes its tables, history and settings. The links already in your entries stay as they are; your content is not touched."
msgstr "Elimina sus tablas, el historial y los ajustes. Los enlaces que ya hay en tus entradas se quedan como están; tu contenido no se toca."

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Guardar ajustes"

#: assets/build/index.js:62
msgid "Could not load the setup information."
msgstr "No se pudo cargar la información del asistente."

#. translators: 1: current step, 2: number of steps.
#: assets/build/index.js:63
msgid "Step %1$s of %2$s"
msgstr "Paso %1$s de %2$s"

#: assets/build/index.js:63
msgid "What do we link?"
msgstr "¿Qué enlazamos?"

#: assets/build/index.js:63
msgid "Artificial intelligence"
msgstr "Inteligencia artificial"

#: assets/build/index.js:63
msgid "All set"
msgstr "Todo listo"

#. translators: 1: current step, 2: number of steps.
#: assets/build/index.js:64
msgid "Setup · step %1$s of %2$s"
msgstr "Arranque · paso %1$s de %2$s"

#. translators: %s: language name.
#: assets/build/index.js:65
msgid "Language detected: %s."
msgstr "Idioma detectado: %s."

#: assets/build/index.js:65
msgid "Your site is multilingual: we will link each language separately."
msgstr "Tu sitio es multilingüe: enlazaremos cada idioma por separado."

#: assets/build/index.js:65
msgid "Entries are only linked to others in the same language."
msgstr "Las entradas solo se enlazan con otras del mismo idioma."

#: assets/build/index.js:65
msgid "Your WordPress has an AI connector. This version of Magic Linking does not use it yet: suggestions come from its own engine, which needs no AI. When AI features arrive they will use that connector, and nothing will be spent without showing you an estimate first."
msgstr "Tu WordPress tiene un conector de IA. Esta versión de Magic Linking todavía no lo usa: las sugerencias salen de su propio motor, que no necesita IA. Cuando lleguen las funciones de IA usarán ese conector, y no se gastará nada sin enseñarte antes una estimación."

#: assets/build/index.js:65
msgid "No AI connected: Magic Linking works with its own engine, which needs no AI. You can connect one whenever you like in Settings → Connectors."
msgstr "Sin IA conectada: Magic Linking funciona con su propio motor, que no necesita IA. Puedes conectar una cuando quieras en Ajustes → Conectores."

#: assets/build/index.js:65
msgid "Analyzing only reads your content; it never changes it. Links are only added when you press Link."
msgstr "Analizar solo lee tu contenido; nunca lo cambia. Los enlaces solo se añaden cuando pulsas Enlazar."

#: assets/build/index.js:65
msgid "The analysis is running. You can close this screen: it continues in the background."
msgstr "El análisis está en marcha. Puedes cerrar esta pantalla: sigue en segundo plano."

#: assets/build/index.js:65
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Empezar"

#: assets/build/index.js:65
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Atrás"

#: assets/build/index.js:65
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Cerrar"

#: assets/build/index.js:65
msgid "Skip setup"
msgstr "Saltar el asistente"

#: assets/build/index.js:65
msgid "You can open this assistant again from Settings."
msgstr "Puedes volver a abrir este asistente desde Ajustes."

